  "description": "TUnit-native OpenTelemetry distributed-tracing (Activity / span) assertions for .NET tests: fluent Assert.That(activity) entry points for operation name, tag existence and value, status, and single-hop parent/child and same-trace relationships. Span capture is a raw ActivityListener over an ActivitySource. Builds on the TracingAssertions framework-agnostic core. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection in the assertion path, and no NuGet runtime dependency.",
  "id": "TracingAssertions.TUnit",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-06T14:27:38.667Z",
